flowchart TD
    START[record_result<br/>model_type, success, latency_ms] --> D{model_type?}
    
    D -->|local| L{success?}
    L -->|Yes| L1{latency &lt;= threshold?}
    L1 -->|Yes| L2["local_weight = min(1.0, lw + 0.1)<br/>cloud_weight = max(0.0, cw - 0.1)"]
    L1 -->|No| L3[Record latency only<br/>No weight adjustment]
    L -->|No| L4["local_weight = max(0.1, lw - 0.2)<br/>cloud_weight = min(0.9, cw + 0.2)<br/>_local_fail_streak++"]
    
    D -->|cloud| C{success?}
    C -->|Yes| C1["cloud_weight = min(0.9, cw + 0.05)<br/>local_weight = max(0.1, lw - 0.05)"]
    C -->|No| C2["cloud_weight = max(0.1, cw - 0.1)<br/>local_weight = min(0.9, lw + 0.1)<br/>_cloud_fail_streak++"]
    
    L2 --> W[Weight protection<br/>Range 0.1 - 0.9]
    L3 --> W
    L4 --> W
    C1 --> W
    C2 --> W
    
    W --> CB{Check circuit breaker}
    CB --> CBA{_local_fail_streak &gt;= 3?}
    CBA -->|Yes| CBB[Force switch to CLOUD_FIRST]
    CBA -->|No| CBC{_cloud_fail_streak &gt;= 3?}
    CBC -->|Yes| CBD[Force switch to LOCAL_FIRST]
    CBC -->|No| DONE[Update complete]
    CBB --> DONE
    CBD --> DONE

    style L2 fill:#e8f5e9
    style L4 fill:#ffebee
    style C1 fill:#e3f2fd
    style C2 fill:#ffebee
    style CBB fill:#ff9800
    style CBD fill:#ff9800
